      "dcterms:title": "DIAGRAM CATEGORIES FOR Uq-TILTING MODULES",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "ANDERSEN, HENNING HAAHR",
        "TUBBENHAUER, DANIEL"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20171116",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1409.2799",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We give a diagrammatic presentation of the category of Uq(sl2)-tilting modules T for q being a root of unity and introduce a grading on T. This grading is a “root of unity phenomenon” and might lead to new insights about link and 3-manifold invariants deduced from T. We also give a diagrammatic category for the (graded) projective endofunctors on T, indicate how our results could generalize and collect some “well-known” facts to give a reasonably self-contained exposition.",
